WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:00.923
- I gotta ask you though.

00:00:00.923 --> 00:00:02.130
Is it true that you ended
up moving in with your

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:03.450
parents during the pandemic?
- [Nikki] Yes,

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:05.640
and it was for you, too,

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.410
I have you to thank.
- [Kelly] Why?

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:08.910
- I was about to be on your show.

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:09.902
- Oh yes!

00:00:09.902 --> 00:00:11.730
- And COVID hit, and my mom was out here

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:13.110
to appear on the show with me.

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:14.760
And so we were already together

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.500
and I go, you know,
everything's shutting down.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.510
Let me just go back to
St. Louis with my parents.

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:20.700
I'm already with them so
I can't contaminate them.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.610
We'll go back. I'll wait this
thing out till it blows over.

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:24.443
- [Kelly] Oh.

00:00:24.443 --> 00:00:25.710
- [Nikki] And as we
know, it really didn't.

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:26.610
- [Kelly] For like a minute.

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:29.530
- I lived with them for
10 months in St. Louis.

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:31.170
- So do your parents wanna thank me

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.824
or do they wanna not thank me.

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:34.110
(audience laughing)

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.950
- They have some words,
Kelly, but it was fun.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:37.783
- But that's cool though,

00:00:37.783 --> 00:00:38.616
cause we don't get time like that

00:00:38.616 --> 00:00:39.875
usually with family, that's cool.

00:00:39.875 --> 00:00:40.708
- [Nikki] And I have cool parents,

00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:41.541
like they're really fun.

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.438
And by that, I mean
alcoholic, but I just...

00:00:43.438 --> 00:00:45.768
(audience laughing)

00:00:45.768 --> 00:00:48.000
No, I actually, I shouldn't,
I shouldn't do that joke,

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.828
cause my mom just quit
talking to me and, so....

00:00:50.828 --> 00:00:52.230
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.720
No, they're great. I
eventually had to move out

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.030
because it was so
embarrassing, cause I liked it.

00:00:57.030 --> 00:01:00.540
And the real reason I
lived at home is because I,

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:01.920
you know, I don't have a husband.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:03.690
I didn't have like anyone else.

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:04.800
- [Kelly] To like quarantine with, yeah.

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:06.030
- Yeah. And I didn't wanna be alone.

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:06.863
And so I was just...

00:01:06.863 --> 00:01:07.696
- I think it's cool.

00:01:07.696 --> 00:01:09.154
- [Nikki] Thank you.
- Yeah.

00:01:09.154 --> 00:01:11.190
- I felt embarrassed though,
because people kept asking,

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:13.498
you know, usually you live
at home with your parents

00:01:13.498 --> 00:01:15.900
if things aren't going well.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:18.840
So people are just like,
'you're successful. You're 37.

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:20.610
Why are you living with your mom and dad?'

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:21.720
So I got rid of that therapist

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:23.250
and I was just like,
(audience laughing)

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:24.253
let's just not go into it.

00:01:24.253 --> 00:01:25.950
- Let's just leave it alone.

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:27.785
- [Nikki] Yeah, like we
don't need to go in there.

00:01:27.785 --> 00:01:29.618
- [Kelly] Like, why would
we need to resurface that?

00:01:29.618 --> 00:01:30.660
- Yes
- (laughs) I love you so much.

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:31.493
So wait, I have to talk

00:01:31.493 --> 00:01:33.930
about this because now
you're hosting FBoy Island.

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:34.830
- Yes.

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:36.510
- So what exactly is an Fboy?

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:40.701
- It is, the F honestly
stands for fragile.

00:01:40.701 --> 00:01:41.779
(audience laughing)

00:01:41.779 --> 00:01:44.098
It's like, Fboys are guys
that haven't addressed

00:01:44.098 --> 00:01:47.593
their childhood trauma,
the anger they have

00:01:47.593 --> 00:01:49.140
towards women or themselves.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:52.410
And then they lie to women
to get to sleep with them

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:53.700
or get something out of them.

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:54.990
Cause they don't have enough self-esteem,

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.430
like, that's what it comes down to.

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:57.534
- You are a therapist.
- Thank you, thank you.

00:01:57.534 --> 00:01:59.873
- [Kelly] That's what's happening here.

